  70+ 663E                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------
  71+ 663E                  ; Input: destra?
  72+ 663E                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------
  73+ 663E CB 4A            bit  $01, d
  74+ 6640 20 54            jr   nz, movePlayer_right
  75+ 6642
  76+ 6642                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------
  77+ 6642                  ; Input: sinistra?
